<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_2c6c2c1ffb8347828f1d35f3dd2aac3cafdadbbfbe963f67211a09572c0f3b68_n0002/e_0025/normalization> <http://digistrucmed.org/normalizationMappingMethod> "NONE" .
